{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cff22334f259ef9f","x":0,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Crypto bars\n\nAlpaca crypto: real-time, complete, free. The best data surface we have.\n\n`finb.data.sources.alpaca`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"386b2ba2201a0e0e","x":0,"y":205,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## US equities\n\nAlpaca IEX feed — only 2.4% of the tape. Feed choice is explicit at every call site.\n\n`finb.data.sources.alpaca`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"0a2fc9478aacd312","x":0,"y":410,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Universe archive\n\nDated snapshots of what was tradeable. Cannot be backfilled — run daily.\n\n`finb.data.universe`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"e2105b538126683c","x":0,"y":615,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Macro (FRED)\n\n9 series, initial-release-only so revisions cannot leak. Orthogonal to price.\n\n`finb.data.sources.macro`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"57762d5f1a5f97d6","x":0,"y":820,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## News (Benzinga)\n\nVerified reachable. Article counts and z-scores — the only non-price signal we have.\n\n`finb.data.sources.news`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"c7dcdb80583cd097","x":-30,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":1070,"type":"group","label":"Free data in"},
		{"id":"f3c45b69bb63a924","x":470,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Parquet lake\n\nPartitioned by symbol and year. Idempotent writes, atomic renames.\n\n`finb.data.lake`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"5ece240085b9ad85","x":470,"y":205,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Gap detection\n\nKnows which bars it *should* have. A hole must never read as a quiet market.\n\n`finb.data.lake`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"83655a5560ef1c43","x":470,"y":410,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Market calendar\n\nNYSE holidays, early closes, T+1, session windows. Pinned to published dates.\n\n`finb.clock`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"87536b3b9e1eccb8","x":440,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":660,"type":"group","label":"Store"},
		{"id":"4f944542e06cd6f2","x":940,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Indicators\n\n18 causal technical features. Every one passes the leakage audit.\n\n`finb.features.indicators`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"c7775e9214ae79db","x":940,"y":205,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Labels\n\nTriple-barrier targets: path-aware, volatility-scaled, and they report when they resolve.\n\n`finb.features.labeling`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"164c4a27d71c0413","x":940,"y":410,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Purged CV\n\nRemoves training samples whose label window overlaps the test fold. Without it, shuffled k-fold scores 0.955 on a random walk.\n\n`finb.models.cv`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"1d06a0d76f000e6e","x":940,"y":615,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Model\n\nLightGBM, trained only under purged CV. Scores at chance on noise, learns real signal.\n\n`finb.models.gbdt`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"88d39b875cae8039","x":910,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":865,"type":"group","label":"Think"},
		{"id":"813221ca5f14cb83","x":1410,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Shadow book\n\nSimulated $500 account. Long-only, no leverage, costs charged on every fill.\n\n`finb.sim.engine`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"065c5c297f3c4990","x":1410,"y":205,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Leakage audit\n\nTruncation-equality and future-noise checks. Catches lookahead automatically.\n\n`finb.features.leakage`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"628bc3a256e9c8b9","x":1410,"y":410,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Costs & slippage\n\nFees, spread, regulatory. Crypto round trips cost 17x equities — the finding that set the holding period.\n\n`finb.sim.costs`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"caa155adf81fddd2","x":1410,"y":615,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Account rules\n\nT+1 settlement, good-faith violations, broker policies. PDT was repealed 2026-06-04.\n\n`finb.sim.constraints`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"9f00fad98badc133","x":1410,"y":820,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Holding policy\n\nMinimum hold derived from cost: equity 8d, crypto 38d. Breadth is mandatory.\n\n`finb.sim.policy`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"6ae0daf5565d759b","x":1380,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":1070,"type":"group","label":"Test"},
		{"id":"850bf1071c5e3d8c","x":1880,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Search ledger\n\nEvery variant, observation and hypothesis ever. Append-only, survives restarts.\n\n`finb.evaluation.ledger`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"3c5b492776742690","x":1880,"y":205,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## The gate\n\nDeflated Sharpe vs the luck hurdle, corrected for correlated trials.\n\n`finb.evaluation.gate`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"2be88ca4242c76e8","x":1880,"y":410,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Null cohort\n\nBlock-bootstrapped zero-skill controls from real data. The empirical noise floor.\n\n`finb.evaluation.null_cohort`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"22bab83233dbc6d2","x":1850,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":660,"type":"group","label":"Judge"},
		{"id":"11a110bbef1bcc07","x":2350,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Risk limits\n\nOne-way kill switch, concentration and leverage caps, vol-targeted sizing.\n\n`finb.risk.limits`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"be62562725d30894","x":2350,"y":205,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"4","type":"text","text":"## Alpaca paper\n\nThree independent locks before live. Sizes against our $500, not the broker's $95k.\n\n`finb.execution.alpaca_paper`\n\n✅"},
		{"id":"ba56eace7744690d","x":2320,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":455,"type":"group","label":"Act"},
		{"id":"be6c324c05dd1f47","x":2350,"y":470,"width":340,"height":200,"color":"1","type":"text","text":"## 🔒 Paper only\n\nTwo independent locks before any real order:\n\n1. `FINB_ALLOW_LIVE` set to the magic string\n2. the variant has passed the gate\n\nSee [[0001 Paper only and the live guard]]"},
		{"id":"33c4bc1da268d5ff","x":-470,"y":0,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"6","type":"file","file":"00-Map/Fin B.md"},
		{"id":"0b7bb242a39cd25d","x":-470,"y":205,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"6","type":"file","file":"90-Reference/Luck Hurdle.md"},
		{"id":"5bf0fa273f273c46","x":-470,"y":410,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"6","type":"file","file":"20-Architecture/Decisions.md"},
		{"id":"377a4204332f811b","x":-470,"y":615,"width":340,"height":150,"color":"6","type":"file","file":"00-Map/Open Questions.md"},
		{"id":"ebcc025225c0b904","x":-500,"y":-70,"width":400,"height":865,"type":"group","label":"The thinking"}
	],
